# Supervisor hub routing

## Operator rule

Address **only `@supervisor`** in the Agents Window. Do not task stack agents directly.

## Stack agent rule

If the user assigns work without a supervisor delegation block, respond:

> Route this through `@supervisor`. I accept assignments from the Supervisor only (criterion IDs + scope required).

Then stop — do not implement.

## Supervisor rule

Plan → delegate → prove → PASS/FAIL. See `mtg-ebay-meta/MULTITASK.md`.
